  "workspace/CLAUDE.md": "# Build fix-login-workspace

- Blueprint: Bugfix, version 3
- This is the workspace session's folder; session containers read it but never write it
- Plugin folder: plugin/ in this folder; run sessions reach it as \${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}

## Session containers

- The workspace session's environment holds each container's variables below, set fresh for every run
- Run a container's start command as written, from a shell, at most once per run; it returns at once, and the container then runs its own Start to Stop in its own tmux session

### Session container main (main)

- Name: main
- Repository: /work/repo
- Branch: flowdeck/fix-login
- Worktree: /fd-home/workspaces/b1111111-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/sessions/main/repo
- Model: sonnet
- Variables: FD_SESSION_MAIN_TMUX holds its tmux name, FD_SESSION_MAIN_ID its Claude session id

\`\`\`sh
tmux -L "$FD_SESSION_MAIN_TMUX" new-session -d -s "$FD_SESSION_MAIN_TMUX" -c '/fd-home/workspaces/b1111111-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/sessions/main/repo' -e FLOWDECK_SOCK="$FLOWDECK_SOCK" -e FLOWDECK_HOOK_NODE="$FLOWDECK_HOOK_NODE" -e FLOWDECK_HOOK_SCRIPT="$FLOWDECK_HOOK_SCRIPT" -e CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_BACKGROUND_TASKS=1 env -u CLAUDECODE -u CLAUDE_CODE_SESSION_ID -u CLAUDE_CODE_CHILD_SESSION -u CLAUDE_CODE_ENTRYPOINT -u CLAUDE_CODE_EXECPATH -u CLAUDE_CODE_MESSAGING_SOCKET -u CLAUDE_CODE_MESSAGING_TOKEN -u CLAUDE_CODE_SESSION_ATTENDED -u CLAUDE_PID -u CLAUDE_EFFORT claude --session-id "$FD_SESSION_MAIN_ID" --model 'sonnet' --settings '/fd-home/workspaces/b1111111-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/sessions/main/settings.json' --plugin-dir '/fd-home/workspaces/b1111111-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/sessions/main/plugin' --add-dir '/fd-home/workspaces/b1111111-0000-4000-8000-000000000001/workspace' '/fix-login-main:run'
\`\`\`

