# Run fix-login-workspace

Run these steps in order. Agent and Fork steps only hand off: each goes to its agents; never do that work yourself. Do every other step as its line says. Wait for each step's result before the next.

Hand-off files are read and written by bare name (\`<file>\`, not \`workspace/<file>\`) in the run's working folder. A run starts there; for the workspace session that folder is \`workspace/\`.

1. NODE workspace-1-start (workspace-1-start): the run starts here. Then go on to NODE workspace-1-stop.
2. NODE workspace-1-stop (workspace-1-stop): the run ends here; its result is \`result\` (text), handed back to the user, not a file any step writes.
",
  "workspace/settings.json": "{
  "enableAllProjectMcpServers": true,
  "env": {
    "CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_BACKGROUND_TASKS": "1"
  },
  "permissions": {
    "defaultMode": "default"
  }
}
",
}
`;
